# INV-04 — invented. Two overs a side in a cup: level, and a super over decides it.
# Edge cases: a tie under a cup's conditions (a tie goes to a super over); the
# super over's two innings, the side batting second in the match batting
# first; openers out of the batting order; two wickets ending a super over
# before its six balls; a non-striker who never faced.
match INV-04
title Two overs, a tie and a super over
date 2026-11-04
overs 2
sides Home Away
conditions cup

innings 1 Home
open B1 B2
over BW1  4 . 1 6 . 1
over BW2  W:b 2 . nb 1 1 .

innings 2 Away
open B1 B2
over BW1  1 4 . 2b 6 .
over BW2  1 W:c/F9 1 . 1 1

super 1 Away
open B1 B4
over BW3  4 W:b 1 6 . 2

super 1 Home
open B3 B1
over BW4  6 W:c/F2 4 W:lbw

